    "expression_position": {
      "x": 6,
      "y": 498
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "「しかし『初日はこれで終了』って話だけど、いったい何日つづくのかしらね『巫女修行』は……？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "「まぁ、ふつうに考えて土日だけだと思うけど。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 20,
    "dress": "old-yukata",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-yukata_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 6,
      "y": 498
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "「平日までは、さすがにこっちも付きあいきれないしね～？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 20,
    "dress": "old-yukata",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-yukata_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 6,
      "y": 498
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "「でも友達とお泊まりなんて初めてで、ちょっと浮き浮きしちゃうかも。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "「あぁもう嬉しいなぁ、楽しいなぁ……♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "「あぁ、すっかり日も暮れちゃったわね。楽しい時間はあっという間ね～？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "「にっくきラクロス部への憂さも晴らせたし、食事もお風呂もあって至れり尽くせりよね～？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "「毎日『巫女修行』でもいいぐらいっ♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 20,
    "dress": "old-yukata",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-yukata_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 6,
      "y": 498
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "「毎日があんな生き地獄じゃあ、さすがにラクロス部は可哀想だけどね……」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 20,
    "dress": "old-yukata",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-yukata_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 6,
      "y": 498
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "「まぁ、こっちは気が晴れたし。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "「これで『部活荒らし』については『禊ぎは済んだ』ってことにしてあげるわっ♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 20,
    "dress": "old-yukata",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-yukata_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 6,
      "y": 498
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "「あれだけ酷い目に遭えば、連中もさすがに懲りたでしょうしね。二度と、悪さもしないでしょ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 20,
    "dress": "old-yukata",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-yukata_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 6,
      "y": 498
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "「あぁ、心も身体もぽっかぽか♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "「いいわね～、この神社。敷地内に天然の温泉まであるなんてね。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "「近所に銭湯もあるっぽいし、たぶん湯脈が通ってんのね～？」"
