    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-yukata_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 6,
      "y": 498
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "「しかし、堀田と猫塚は長風呂ね。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 20,
    "dress": "old-yukata",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-yukata_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 6,
      "y": 498
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "「まぁ猫塚は滝壺に落ちてたしね、身体も冷えてるし汚れちゃってるんでしょ。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "「堀田は、その背中でも流してやってるのかしら？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "「堀田のやつ、ほんと後輩に甘いんだから」"
